*Summary* (06.09 UPD) - [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] - FYI:

Marketing Distribution Team is planning co-marketing activities with BCR Bank in RO. All information on the details of the campaign are in the main ticket.

Bolt and BCR will act as separate data controllers. Bolt`s processing activity in relation to the campaign - communication of the offer to its users through direct marketing and in-app messages.

Details of the advice:

{panel:bgColor=#e3fcef}
*Direct marketing compliance:*

Confirmed that only users who opted in to receive third-party marketing will receive the offer via direct marketing; in-app modals will be presented to all users, as its not direct marketing;
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#eae6ff}
*Data sharing compliance:*

*No personal data is being shared between Bolt and BCR. Details:*

* Bolt will only know that a user came from the campaign when the user uses a promocode shared previously between BCR and Bolt.
* BCR will be able to understand that a user came from Bolt as users will be using referral link only available in Bolt app; no tracking of personal data / individual accounts will occur.
* as standard, the agreements between BCR and Bolt clarify that no personal data is going to be shared between the parties.
* to safeguard against exceptional cases (sharing of personal data in case of fraud investigation, etc) - privacy added light touch C2C clauses to the Annexes 1 and 2 of the Partner Agreement. [^Partnership contract BOLT X BCR_privacy_review_15.08.2024.docx]
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
Re/ T&C - BCR clarifies its data processing activities via section 6 of its T&C for the campaign. Bolt will only process personal data to communicate the offer to its users via push and direct marketing, and should be covered by the provisions of its current Privacy Notice for Riders (purpose “*For marketing and advertising*”).

To add clarity for DSs, it was suggested to add the following clauses to the BCR T&C:

# _Bolt and BCR will each process your personal data as independent data controllers. Bolt is not responsible for the BCR's processing of your personal data._
# _Bolt will only use your personal data to communicate with you about the Campaign through direct marketing and in-app notifications, in line with our privacy notices. For more information about how Bolt handles your personal data, your rights, and contact details for privacy-related inquiries, please refer to our privacy notices. available at_ [https://bolt.eu/ro-ro/privacy/|https://bolt.eu/ro-ro/privacy/] .
